{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@2969","endTime":336572.618,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 16\nWhizara.\n\nA course-focused website using bold educational imagery, course entry points, and a distinct learning identity.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nCourses & learning\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nMake the next course easy to discover.\n\nWhizara’s web designs introduce a course-based learning experience. A prominent course headline and call to action lead the landing page, followed by educational imagery and supporting sections. The gallery keeps the Whizara-specific graphics and excludes ES-Platform assets copied into the original detail page.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Whizara's original project material.\n\n01\nCourse entry\n\nA clear primary action invites visitors to explore courses.\n\n02\nLearning presentation\n\nEducational imagery establishes the subject of the offering.\n\n03\nIntroductory content\n\nSupporting sections explain the website’s learning proposition.\n\n04\nWebsite layouts\n\nThe supplied assets include project-specific browser designs.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nCourses & learning\n\nDeep purple and warm orange create a recognizable learning brand. Large type, illustrated details, and contrasting action buttons establish a confident opening, with white sections allowing the course content room to breathe.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Whizara.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n05\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nWhizara's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nWhizara / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nEs-Platform\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nLEARNING OPERATIONS\nEs-Platform\nSERVICES MARKETPLACE\nBeen There\nLEAD CAPTURE & FORMS\nLead Management\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
